        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>12~18月龄宝宝的辅食攻略 - 经典食谱</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .book {\n    display: flex;\n    background: #f2f2ee;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .cover-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; right: 0;\n    height: 14px;\n    background: #cfcfc9;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .cover-top { top: 0; }\n  .cover-bottom { bottom: 0; }\n  .page {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 26px 20px 20px 20px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .page.left { border-right: 1px dashed #ccc; }\n  h1.page-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .section-heading {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: #eef3e2;\n    border-left: 4px solid #7ab63e;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #4c7a1f;\n  }\n  .section-heading .dot {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #7ab63e;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  ul.plain-list {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  ul.plain-list li { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n  .sub-note {\n    margin: 4px 0 8px 0;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .photo-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .photo-row.bottom { margin-top: 6px; }\n  .placeholder.circle {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align: center;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .photo-cell {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .photo-cell .caption {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .advice-block { line-height: 1.7; }\n  .advice-block .label { font-weight: 700; }\n  .indent-line { margin-left: 10px; }\n  .footer-note {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #999;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  /* Right page recipes */\n  .recipe {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .recipe-title {\n    background: #7ab63e;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border-radius: 2px 10px 2px 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .recipe-body {\n    margin: 6px 0 0 4px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .recipe-body .field-label { font-weight: 700; }\n  .recipe-body ol {\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .recipe-body ol li { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"book\">\n  <div class=\"cover-strip cover-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"cover-strip cover-bottom\"></div>\n\n  <!-- LEFT PAGE -->\n  <div class=\"page left\">\n    <h1 class=\"page-title\">12～18月龄宝宝的辅食攻略</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>喂养重点</div>\n    <ul class=\"plain-list\">\n      <li>注重营养均衡摄取，鼓励宝宝和家人共同感受进食氛围</li>\n      <li>开始培养宝宝良好的饮食习惯，减少宝宝对辅食的依赖性和偏食挑食</li>\n      <li>让爸爸妈妈对宝宝的喂养有耐心，不要强迫喂食</li>\n      <li>可以开始尝试蔬菜、豆制品、菌类海鲜、坚果等食材</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>辅食性状</div>\n    <div class=\"sub-note\">长块状的食物（以米饭、面条、猪肉、菠菜、南瓜为例）</div>\n\n    <div class=\"photo-row top\">\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder circle\">[Photo: 米饭]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">米饭</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder circle\">[Photo: 面条]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">面条</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder circle\">[Photo: 猪肉]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">猪肉</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-row bottom\">\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder circle\">[Photo: 菠菜]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">菠菜</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder circle\">[Photo: 南瓜]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">南瓜</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>喂养建议</div>\n    <div class=\"advice-block\">\n      <div><span class=\"label\">乳制品喂养：</span>每日2次，总计400-600ml</div>\n      <div><span class=\"label\">辅食喂养：</span>每日3次，每次1碗</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">谷薯类：各种家常谷类3/4-1碗</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">蔬菜类：各种蔬菜1/2-2/3碗</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">水果类：各种水果1/2-2/3碗</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">肉、蛋、鱼、豆类：每日10-15g，豆制品6-8个</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">油：每日10-15g，盐&lt;1.5g</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-note\">[illegible: 页脚小字说明/版权信息]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RIGHT PAGE -->\n  <div class=\"page right\">\n    <h1 class=\"page-title\">经典食谱</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-title\">食谱一：牛滑肉</div>\n      <div class=\"recipe-body\">\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">材料：</span>牛肉、木耳、白菜、香菇、南瓜</div>\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">做法：</span></div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>牛滑肉片切成薯片，木耳发泡切碎，用刀将白菜切片，香菇切片放入沸水中煮片刻</li>\n          <li>锅中下锦滑肉片炒变色，再依次放入木耳、白菜、香菇，加少许盐调味即可</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-title\">食谱二：青椒爆猪肝</div>\n      <div class=\"recipe-body\">\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">材料：</span>猪肝、青椒、葱、姜、食用油</div>\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">做法：</span></div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>猪肝在水里泡，然后处理，加上一起放锅内炒大火，高汤浸洗放入猪肝</li>\n          <li>热锅倒油加入姜和葱丝，下猪肝炒熟至小片，然后加入青椒炒匀即可</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-title\">食谱三：土豆胡萝卜牛肉</div>\n      <div class=\"recipe-body\">\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">材料：</span>土豆、胡萝卜、姜片、食用油</div>\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">做法：</span></div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>将胡萝卜和土豆和牛肉分别切好切片，加适量水炖煮到牛肉变熟软烧</li>\n          <li>熟软后加入盐调味即可，放入一点葱花小炒至香即可</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-title\">食谱四：鲜虾玉米粥</div>\n      <div class=\"recipe-body\">\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">材料：</span>鲜虾、玉米、葱、姜、食用油</div>\n        <div><span class=\"field-label\">做法：</span></div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>鲜虾洗净去除虾线，去头去壳，玉米粒洗净切碎</li>\n          <li>锅中放入玉米粒煮熟，放热油放入姜片</li>\n          <li>加入切好的玉米、虾，翻炒至熟后，再放入葱花翻炒几下即可</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
